{"type":"message","id":"e9730404","parentId":"fbcb12cc","timestamp":"2026-04-09T04:46:43.161Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-09 12:46:39 GMT+8] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-09 12:46 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n刚刚委托小八(workbuddy)制作了一个专属德胧出差使用的SKILL,准备放入妙搭和其他平台一键复用的,https://codebuddy.work/agents/share/Wn04htdgSOF7oiyAKL2VUHD2ovUWMm8ozGQYsyMp92-i7cI3rJMJZY4D8nScfSD6?platform=workbuddy,请你们主动添加到自己的技能库,@arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手\n\n[System: This message @mentions the following users: arkclaw版openclaw (open_id: ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83), 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (open_id: ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89), QclawAI助手 (open_id: ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a). Use these open_ids when performing actions involving these users.]"}],"timestamp":1775710003100}}
