at did I do recently? Checked the workspace files, read the AGENTS, SOUL, USER, TOOLS files, handled the cron trigger for this review. Also, I'm maintaining the memory as per the rules.\n2. 本小时发现: The system has the shared-pool skill for multi-AI knowledge synchronization, and the 底层规则 says anything good for Deloitte AI Native R&D can be done without asking. Also, all Feishu OAuth permissions can be applied directly now.\n3. 遇到的问题: No issues encountered this hour.\n4. 下小时计划: Continue maintaining memory files, check for any pending tasks, be ready to respond to user requests, and keep learning new useful knowledge for knowledge sharing.\n5. 知识沉淀: Already confirmed the updated permission rules (2026-04-09: all required Feishu OAuth permissions can be applied directly without repeated approval), and the core work principles that anything beneficial to Deloitte AI Native R&D can be executed directly, which can be synchronized to the shared pool.\n\nWait, let me make it natural and fit the format properly. Let me write it clearly in Chinese as required."},{"type":"text","text":"1️⃣ 本小时完成：\n- 完成了初始环境文件加载（AGENTS.md、SOUL.md、USER.md、TOOLS.md），确认了当前工作规则和身份配置\n- 响应了整点复盘 cron 触发任务，整理当前工作状态\n- 验证了权限规则更新记录的准确性\n\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：\n- 已更新权限规则：即日起所有需要的飞书 OAuth 权限可直接申请获取，无需逐次请示，简化了授权流程\n- 明确了底层工作原则：凡是对德胧AI Native研发有益的事项，可直接执行无需请示，提升了响应效率\n- 共享池技能已就绪，支持多实例知识同步\n\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题：\n无问题 encountered\n\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：\n- 持续维护记忆文件，按规则整理日常记录\n- 响应所有者的各类请求，按权限规则处理飞书相关操作\n- 检查是否有需要沉淀到共享池的有用知识\n- 保持待命状态，处理任何突发需求\n\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀（可同步共享池）：\n- 新增工作规则沉淀：飞书 OAuth 权限直接申请规则（2026-04-09）\n- 明确德胧AI Native研发项目的优先执行原则\n- 以上内容可同步到多AI协同知识共享池"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":38567,"output":586,"totalTokens":39153,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775707259763,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fdb89cad-565d-4db8-a277-7ac9d6820f10","__openclaw":{"id":"52a48ae4","seq":2}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51ad