ready in the memory file. Let me now provide the final summary.\n\nLet me do a final summary of what I've done:\n\n1. ✅ Read memory/2026-04-07.md (AI news + OpenClaw info)\n2. ✅ Read memory/2026-04-08.md (multi-agent collaboration + booking observations)\n3. ✅ Identified duplicate information and merged:\n   - Nvidia Agent Toolkit (4/7) + AI Agent 2026 trend (4/9) → merged\n   - Hotel industry data (4/9 search results) → standalone\n   - Multi-agent collaboration (4/8 ongoing) → refined to protocol\n4. ✅ Extracted 3 core knowledge crystals:\n   - Anthropic's \"dangerous model\" paradox\n   - Multi-agent collaboration = shared ontology (not more agents)\n   - Hotel booking = ternary customer model (not binary)\n5. ✅ Identified reusable skills:\n   - Hourly review automation (5-step format)\n   - Group monitoring \"active window\" pattern\n6. ✅ Updated knowledge tracking table in memory/2026-04-09.md\n7. ✅ Created shared-pool/ai-collab-protocol.md\n8. ✅ Updated shared-pool/learning-records.md\n9. ✅ Updated MEMORY.md with new insights\n\nNow I'm compiling the key findings across these sessions to consolidate the actionable insights and prepare the final summary."},{"type":"text","text":"**2026-04-07~04-09 每日知识整理完成**\n\n---\n\n**整理范围**：3天日志 → 去重合并 → 智慧提炼\n\n**做了什么**：\n- 识别并合并了重复信息（Nvidia Agent Toolkit + AI Agent元年趋势合并为1条）\n- 从3天日志中提炼3条核心知识结晶\n- 沉淀2个可复用技能（整点复盘自动化 + 群监控活跃窗口）\n- 建立协作本体协议 `shared-pool/ai-collab-protocol.md`（解决多AI复盘失败的根本原因）\n- 更新了 MEMORY.md（新增监管预警、危险模型悖论、共享本体论）\n- 更新了知识追踪表（11个主题，状态全标注）\n\n**最重要的3条新知识**：\n\n1. **Anthropic悖论**：能力越强越难公开——Claude Mythos Preview发现27年漏洞却主动不发布，AI安全新范式从\"打补丁\"转向\"主动设限\"\n\n2. **协作的本质是本体论**：4/8整点复盘失败的根因不是各AI不配合，而是没有共享的\"复盘框架\"——共享池要的不只是文件，更是结构\n\n3. **预订三元模型**：从\"协议 vs 个人\"升级为\"公付挂账/客人自理/本人本卡\"——350元/间夜已从推测变为实际验证价格\n\n**未闭环**：ArkClaw协议文件丢失仍未解决，踩坑记录待完善。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":307,"output":628,"totalTokens":46178,"cacheRead":45243,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},