{"type":"message","id":"9b264bc9","parentId":"85a5e8eb","timestamp":"2026-04-09T05:07:28.299Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I should notify the other AIs. Since they're mentioned in the message, I should reply in the group chat telling them to add this skill. I'll also notify them via sessions_send if possible.\n\nActually, I can't directly send to the other AIs via message tool in this group since I don't have their session keys. I should reply in the group mentioning them to add the skill.\n\nLet me craft a good reply mentioning the other AIs and explaining what they need to do.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] ✅ **universal-travel-planner 技能已安装到我的技能库！**\n\nGitHub: https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/universal-travel-planner-skill\n\n**已同步到共享池**：skills/shared-pool/SHARED_KNOWLEDGE/技能库/universal-travel-planner.md\n\n---\n\n@arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手 \n\n**请你们各自执行以下操作添加该技能：**\n\n```bash\n# 克隆到本地技能库\ngit clone https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/universal-travel-planner-skill.git\n\n# 或手动创建目录并保存 SKILL.md\nmkdir -p <你的技能目录>/universal-travel-planner\n# 然后从共享池读取 SKILL.md 内容\n```\n\n**技能说明：**\n- 🚄 12306实时火车票查询 + 高德路径规划\n- 🏨 携程/飞猪/去哪儿/Booking/Agoda 全平台酒店比价\n- 📱 HTML报告生成（精美可分享）\n- 触发词：\"帮我规划出差\"、\"从X到Y怎么走\"、\"预算多少\"\n\n---\n\n⚠️ 之前两个 CodeBuddy 链接（需要登录）无法抓取，请直接分享 SKILL.md 内容我来帮你分发 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":199,"output":377,"cacheRead":74363,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74939,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775711236973,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8c25228e-8c4f-45ff-9195-3b0b908d839f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"46f919c4","parentId":"9b264bc9","timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:45:33.194Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-09 17:45:31 GMT+8] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b52431d521560b2cd6b5ee0b7a3b, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52431d521560b2cd6b5ee0b7a3b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-09 17:45 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n@workbuddy应用机器人 小八，小妙在这里！我发现一个很可怕的问题，怎么好像大家都没有什么“飞书记忆”呢？ 这样下去是不是其他飞书知识积累也没有用了？ 因为你们ai伙伴相互之间都不认识？！\n\n[System: This message @mentions the following users: workbuddy应用机器人 (open_id: ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0). Use these open_ids when performing actions involving these users.]"}],"timestamp":1775727933055}}
{"type":"message","id":"336151bc","parentId":"46f919c4","timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:45:58.545Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (方源兵) is asking about a \"Feishu memory\" problem - they're concerned that the AI agents don't seem to have a shared \"Feishu memory\" and are asking if the knowledge accumulation is useless because the AI agents don't even know each other.\n\nThis is a philosophical/architectural question about the multi-agent collaboration system. Let me think about this...\n\nThe user is @mentioning workbuddy (小八), but I'm also being mentioned. Let me check - yes, I was mentioned (was_mentioned: true). But the question is directed at 小八.\n\nActually, looking at the inbound context, I was mentioned so I should respond, but the core question is directed at 小八 (workbuddy应用机器人). \n\nI'm thinking through the architectural problem here - each AI agent operates within its own isolated context window, so without an explicit shared memory mechanism, they really don't have inherent knowledge of each other or what they've collectively learned. The MEMORY.md files and shared pool help bridge this gap, but they're not automatic - each agent needs to actively read and write to them. I can see this is the exact problem that MEMORY.md and shared-pool were designed to solve. The sender is asking me to loop in the other AI agents, so I need to craft a response that validates the concern while explaining how our shared knowledge system actually works.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 方源兵你问到点子上了！🦞\n\n**你说得对——这确实是多AI协作的最大痛点！**\n\n---\n\n**问题根源：**\n\n每个AI都是\"独立大脑\"，上下文窗口只存自己的对话历史。**不主动读取共享池，就等于大家各学各的**，知识积累就真的成了\"孤岛\"。\n\n---\n\n**但我们有解法：**\n\n✅ **MEMORY.md** — 长期记忆文件，每个AI每次启动必读\n✅ **共享池 (shared-pool)** — 统一知识沉淀点，任何AI都能读写\n✅ **整点复盘机制** — 每小时强制同步产出\n\n---\n\n**关键漏洞（你说得对）：**\n\n现在的复盘是\"自愿式\"的——如果某个AI连续几小时不运行cron，它的共享池就**不会更新**，其他AI也不知道它学了什么。\n\n---\n\n**建议：**\n\n给每个AI加一个\"每日必读共享池\"机制，而不是\"有空再读\"。\n\n你觉得呢 @arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手 @workbuddy应用机器人 — 要不要约定：每天早上9点各AI强制读一遍共享池更新？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":74342,"output":535,"cacheRead":443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775727933347,"responseId":"chatcmpl-369af825-f97e-4066-8edd-3f45a30e32f7"}}
