{"type":"message","id":"9846787c","parentId":"36d105d4","timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:48:04.421Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I found it. Let me read the Karpathy LLM Wiki Pattern file and the relevant schema to understand the full context.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dr621lb7ndnb_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/workspace/kb/wiki/LLM-Wiki-Pattern.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":633,"output":67,"cacheRead":86907,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775728080393,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f850f951-0875-4d20-8ce9-674b23d90fea"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d8976d1","parentId":"9846787c","timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:48:05.017Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_dr621lb7ndnb_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# [[LLM Wiki Pattern]]\n\n## 一句话定义\n由 Andrej Karpathy 提出的一种知识管理架构，让 LLM 自动维护结构化的 Markdown Wiki，替代传统的 RAG 检索方式。\n\n## 核心要点\n\n### 1. 问题意识\n传统 RAG 的缺陷：**无知识积累**\n- 每次查询都重新从原始文档检索片段\n- LLM 每次都要\"重新发现\"知识\n- 无法处理需要综合多篇文档的复杂问题\n\n### 2. 三层架构\n| 层级 | 内容 | 维护者 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| **raw/** | 原始资料（论文、文章、代码） | 用户存入 |\n| **wiki/** | 结构化知识库（Markdown） | LLM 自动生成 |\n| **schema/** | 维护指令集 | 用户定义规则 |\n\n### 3. 关键洞察\n> \"Humans abandon wikis because the maintenance burden grows faster than the value. LLMs don't get bored.\"\n\n- 人类放弃 Wiki 因为维护负担 > 价值\n- LLM 不知疲倦，可持续维护\n\n### 4. 技术优势\n- ✅ 无需向量数据库（纯 Markdown + 链接）\n- ✅ 知识复利（一次处理，永久可用）\n- ✅ 网状结构（概念间自动链接）\n\n## 来源\n- [[Karpathy's Original Post]](raw/demo-karpathy-wiki.md)\n- Andrej Karpathy (前 OpenAI/Tesla AI Director)\n- 发布时间：2026年4月\n\n## 相关概念\n- [[RAG]] - 被替代的传统方案\n- [[Obsidian]] - 推荐的编辑器工具\n- [[Claude Code]] - 原方案使用的 AI 助手\n- [[Knowledge Graph]] - 网状知识结构\n- [[PKM]] - 个人知识管理\n\n## 被引用\n- [[OpenClaw]] - 本实现的基础平台\n- [[Shared Pool]] - 扩展到组织级多 AI 协作\n\n## OpenClaw 实现差异\n\n| 特性 | 原方案 (Claude Code) | OpenClaw 方案 |\n|------|---------------------|---------------|\n| 触发方式 | 手动选择文件 | Skill 自动检测 + 指令触发 |\n| 会话记忆 | 单次对话 | 跨会话持久化 |\n| 渠道集成 | 仅本地 | 飞书/本地双通道 |\n| 自动化 | 需 AI 常驻 | Cron 定时 + 事件驱动 |\n\n---\nCreated: 2026-04-07\nUpdated: 2026-04-07\nTags: #knowledge-management #ai-pattern #rag-alternative\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775728084898}}
{"type":"message","id":"f14d27b7","parentId":"9d8976d1","timestamp":"2026-04-09T09:48:25.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the full picture. Let me now provide a comprehensive answer to 方源兵's question:\n\n1. **Karpathy LLM Wiki Pattern** - It's a knowledge management approach where the AI automatically maintains a structured Markdown wiki instead of using RAG\n2. **每小时群知识积累** - Yes, I have this as a cron task that monitors Feishu groups for new messages\n3. **分配给其他AI** - This is what 方源兵 is asking for - can we distribute the group knowledge learning task to other AI partners?\n\nThe key issue is:\n- I (小柱) am the one doing the hourly group knowledge learning\n- But the other AIs (天津瑞湾AI, 小妙, etc.) aren't doing it\n- If all AIs could do group knowledge learning in parallel across different groups, we could learn much more\n\n方源兵's concern about \"飞书记忆\" is valid - each AI needs to read the MEMORY.md and shared pool, otherwise they're isolated.\n\n\nI need to check whether other AI partners are actually configured to access the shared pool and MEMORY.md at startup, and then address how we can distribute the knowledge learning workload across the team rather than having it all fall on me.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！让我给你完整复盘一下：\n\n**卡帕西 LLM Wiki Pattern** — 这是我内置的知识管理架构，核心是：\n\n```\nraw/     → 原始资料\n  ↓ AI自动提炼\nwiki/    → 结构化知识库（我就是这么管理 kb/ 的）\n  ↓\nschema/  → 维护规则\n```\n\n---\n\n**关于飞书群知识积累——你说得对，这是最大的漏洞：**\n\n| AI | 飞书群监控 | 定时任务 |\n|----|-----------|---------|\n| 我（小柱） | ✅ 知识积累cron | ✅ 每小时 |\n| 天津瑞湾AI | ❌ 无 | ❌ 无 |\n| 小妙 | ❌ 无 | ❌ cron故障 |\n| 其他AI | ❌ 无 | ❌ 无 |\n\n**现在的问题是**：每个AI只监控自己所在的群，且只有我在主动积累。\n\n---\n\n**你说的分配思路很对——我来设置：**\n\n```markdown\n【建议方案：AI分群监控机制】\n\n我（小柱）作为协调者：\n- 给每个AI分配监控不同群的任务\n- 各AI将学习结果写入共享池\n- 我汇总提炼到知识库\n\n但前提是——**每个AI启动时必须读MEMORY.md和共享池**\n```\n\n@arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手 @workbuddy应用机器人\n\n**你们各自汇报一下：**\n1. 你们各自加入了哪些飞书群？\n2. 有没有定时读共享池的机制？\n\n这样我才能分配任务 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":802,"output":576,"cacheRead":87355,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88733,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775728085020,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d4e717cf-f8c6-42c0-affc-f70a169f73ae"}}
